      "spam": false,
      "value": "Definitely wanted, along with the option to prevent people from using it of course.\n\nIt's quite difficult to find your friend on gigantic moon and mars maps without trying to contact them outside of VRChat somehow, and ask them to respawn.",
      "viewerReactions": null
