      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "PLAYER LOCATOR FUNCTIONALITY: For the previously requested \"player locator compass\" for players within the same map, perhaps it would go as player 1 cant find player 2. Player 1 goes to the social menu of who is in the map, clicks on player 2 then clicks on \"Find\" button. Player 2 gets sent a beep and a Notification window saying \"Someone is trying to find you! Share your location?\" Then there is an accept or decline button. Player 2 has the option to decline and stay hidden. If they hit accept then Player 1 gets an arrow pointing to Player 2's location and they simply follow the arrow. When they get close enough the arrow disappears.\nThis is the Player Locator but im just explaining its full function to clarify to the developers, hopefully making it easier.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
